proposed_edit.replacement:
* `Complex.dist_le_div_mul_dist_of_mapsTo_ball`: if `f : ℂ → E` sends an open disk with center `c`
  and radius `R₁` to a closed ball with center `f c` and radius `R₂`, then for any `z` in the former
  disk we have `dist (f z) (f c) ≤ (R₂ / R₁) * dist z c`;

* `Complex.dist_le_dist_of_mapsTo_ball_self`: if `f : ℂ → ℂ` maps an open disk with center `c`
  to the closed disk with center `f c` and the same radius `R`, then for any point `z` of this disk
  we have `dist (f z) (f c) ≤ dist z c`;
